      "scope": "At the single response-ingestion transport boundary,23 independently literal stage/dimension pairs span all22 current scope keys: projectRevision and the complete registered required-dimension union. Each starts with an accepted conforming current control, then rejects a type-conforming changed identity with STALE_SCOPE at the exact /scope path and zero accepted canonical changes. The additional Stage2 baseline and evidenceChainVersion cases are prohibited-extra negatives; evidenceChainVersion has no external-agent operation. This establishes transport-scope rejection, not every downstream reference family, stage gate, storage transaction or external-agent behavior.",
